        "text": "def parameterNorm (k : ℕ) (X₀ X₁ : ℝ) (f : Fin m → ℝ → ℝ → ℝ) : ℝ := sSup (jetValues k X₀ X₁ f)  — max over components, over X ∈ Icc X₀ X₁, over n ≤ k, of ‖iteratedFDerivWithin ℝ n (f i X) J η‖"
